[profiles.guide]
notes = '''Hold {select} and {start} together to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller. Tilting the controller moves the cursor, as a fine pointer next to the right stick {rs}.
The right stick {rs} moves the cursor: {rt} selects (left click), and {lt} moves or targets (right click). The left stick {ls} scrolls the map.
Hold {lb} for the control groups: the face buttons and the {dpad} recall groups 1 to 8. Hold {rb} as well to assign the selection to the group instead.
{rb} is Shift: hold it to queue orders or add to the selection. Click {l3} to select every unit of that type on screen (Ctrl + click).
Click {r3} for the heroes (F1 to F3), idle workers (F8), learn skill, town hall and subgroup cycling, aimed with the right stick {rs}. Hero spells and unit abilities aren't mapped: click their cards, or use {guide} + {west} for the keyboard.
{select} jumps to the last alert. Hold {select} for the Menus mode, and hold it again to come back.
{start} (F10) is the game menu.'''

